  "_doc": "Curation on top of the docs directory. Per product: aliases (former names, also matched), terms (replace the default name+aliases match terms; for names that are ordinary words), add_terms, tags (added to the automatic name match), not_tags, parent, categories, status. Terms are case-sensitive; a 'Cloudflare <term>' variant is added automatically. extra = products not in the directory (retired, or missing from it). stop_terms are consumed but credit no product, so 'Service Worker' never counts as Workers.",
